### ── AUTH ──

### Ro'yxatdan o'tish (201)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "azizjon", "password": "secret123" }

### Kirish (200 → token)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "azizjon", "password": "secret123" }

### XATOLIK: noto'g'ri parol → 401
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "azizjon", "password": "yomon" }

### Joriy foydalanuvchi (token kerak)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN_HERE

### ── TASKS (token kerak) ──

### Barcha vazifalar (shaxsiy)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/tasks
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN_HERE

### Yangi vazifa (201)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/tasks
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Express routing amaliyoti", "fan": "Dasturlash", "dueDate": "2026-09-22" }

### XATOLIK: bo'sh nom → 400 (server xabari)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/tasks
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "", "fan": "Dasturlash" }

### XATOLIK: noto'g'ri fan → 400 (enum)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/tasks
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Test", "fan": "Sport" }

### Vazifani bajarilgan qilish (PATCH) → REAL_ID o'rniga haqiqiy id
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/tasks/REAL_ID
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{ "isDone": true }

### Vazifani o'chirish (DELETE) → REAL_ID o'rniga haqiqiy id
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/tasks/REAL_ID
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN_HERE

### Token'ni qanday olamiz: curl bilan
# curl -X POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login -H "Content-Type: application/json" -d '{"username":"azizjon","password":"secret123"}'